title: "CS229 2018 Lecture Notes: Machine Learning, Stanford, Autumn 2018"
abstract: >-
  Free, unofficial lecture notes for Stanford CS229: Machine Learning, written
  from Andrew Ng's Autumn 2018 lectures. Every lecture has a chapter of
  continuous prose with the board derivations written out in full and a
  timestamp into the recording for every section.
